<title>USA: Novi Building Auth, Mich., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Novi Building Auth, Mich., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc. said it won $8.500 million of Novi Building Authority, Mich., 1997 building authority lease revenue bonds with a net interest cost of 5.649 percent.</p>
</text>
